  message: "Reparented to INV-dajaf (META: Symbol identity must be honest across the pipeline). INV-vaguj is a textbook representation-stage violation per INV-dajaf's table: orchestrator producer stamps wrong-shape identity claim into Symbol.name (absolute path) and Symbol.span (1-1 sentinel) on 798+800 nodes. Sibling of INV-hojus, INV-ronuf, INV-mopif which are already correctly parented. Plain missed connection caught during docket-wide review."  # 0ca8
